{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34421","headline":"白鸥诗 · 陆龟蒙","name":"白鸥诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惯向溪头漾浅沙，薄烟微雨是生涯。\n时时失伴沈山影，往往争飞杂浪花。\n晚树清凉还𪈺鳿，旧巢零落寄蒹葭\n池塘信美应难恋，针在鱼唇劒在虾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}